  "tm.l1": "Start in Safe Mode: every block is gone for a while.", "tm.l2": "Turn off accessibility, or the phone turns it off: apps are no longer blocked.", "tm.l3": "Factory reset the phone, change the clock.",
  "tm.do": "Device Owner closes these ways at system level. A blocked app stays locked; it does not open first and get pushed out.",
  "tm.before": "Before you upgrade (on the child phone: Protection and permissions → Tamper protection):",
  "tm.b1": "App accounts (Zalo, Facebook, Telegram...) are kept: KidGuard turns those apps off for a moment and the phone restarts once during setup.",
  "tm.b2": "Phone accounts (Google, Xiaomi, Samsung, Oppo...) must be removed first in Settings → Accounts. Sign in again after setup; online data stays.",
  "tm.b3": "Needs Android 11 or later and Wi-Fi, or a computer.",
