  "ts.s1": "On your phone: install the Tailscale app and sign in (Google/Apple), which also makes your free account.", "ts.s2": "Open the Keys page → <b>Generate access token</b> → Generate → copy it.", "ts.keysPage": "Open the Keys page", "ts.s3": "Paste it below and press Turn on. The kid's phone installs Tailscale in about a minute.", "ts.noExp": "never expires", "ts.expP": "Tailscale will sign {0} out after 180 days (an auth key was used). Turn that off once: Machines page → the {0} row → ⋯ → Disable key expiry. Or turn it on again with an API access token.", "ts.machines": "Open the Machines page", "ts.expDone": "Done", "away.cmp": "Telegram bot (Telegram section below): easiest, SOS and buttons right in Telegram. Tailscale: like at home, live screen and listen, needs the Tailscale app on the parent's phone. Relay: already on, any browser, commands usually arrive in a few seconds, no listen.", "away.h": "When your kid is away", "away.p": "Right now this page controls the child's phone only on the same Wi‑Fi. To manage when your child is out: turn on the relay, Tailscale (about 5 minutes, once) or the Telegram bot (about 2 minutes).", "away.go": "Set up", "away.later": "Later",
  "ts.h": "Remote control via Tailscale", "ts.keep": "Keep Tailscale always on", "ts.keepB": "Kept on", "ts.keepTip": "If Tailscale is closed or cleaned up on the kid's phone, it reconnects by itself (and opens once on the home screen if it has to). Leave it off if Tailscale on this phone is used for something else, e.g. work.", "ts.keepOn": "KidGuard keeps this Tailscale on by itself (it installed it).", "ts.basicOwn": "Installing and signing in Tailscale with a key needs Device Owner. In basic mode: install the Tailscale app on the kid phone and sign in by hand; the switch below still keeps it on.", "kn.basic": "The lock-screen text needs Device Owner. In basic mode the contact number still feeds the Call button on the kid's Today page.", "hm.basic": "Basic mode: first pick KidGuard in Settings › Default apps › Home app on the kid's phone. Then it is locked as far as basic mode can: the Home app page closes and another launcher is sent back to KidGuard (needs Accessibility; Safe Mode or turning Accessibility off bypasses it). With wireless debugging set up, KidGuard also sets itself as the default again.", "ts.basic": "Use the relay (Cloudflare) below, or the Telegram bot, to manage when your child is out.",
  "ts.remove": "Turn off and remove Tailscale", "ts.installTx": "Installing Tailscale on the kid's phone…", "ts.off": "Off", "ts.installing": "Installing / signing in…", "ts.on": "Connected", "ts.error": "Error",
  "ts.p": "No Cloudflare needed: the kid's phone installs Tailscale and joins your private network. Install Tailscale on your phone with the same account, then open the address below.",
