  "tg.localBf": "This management page closes when Telegram opens (the PIN is asked again). Better create the bot with Telegram on your own phone, then come back here to paste the token.", "tg.one": "One bot per child. Two children = two bots (e.g. Bin's home, Na's home), each pasted on that child's page.", "tg.chatAlt": "Example chat with BotFather", "tg.bf1": "How are we going to call it?", "tg.exName": "Bin's home", "tg.bf2": "Choose a username, it must end in <b>bot</b>", "tg.exUser": "binshome_kidguard_bot", "tg.bf3": "Done! Your token:", "tg.taken": "Username taken? Add a few digits, e.g. binshome2026_bot.", "tg.s4h": "Link your Telegram", "tg.s4": "The page shows <b>Open Telegram and link</b> (and a QR code). Tap it, Telegram opens your bot, tap <b>Start</b>. Done: the bot says hello and shows the Menu.", "tg.paste": "Paste", "tg.pasteHand": "The browser won't read the clipboard: long-press the box and choose Paste.", "tg.tokOk": "Token looks right", "tg.tokBad": "No token found yet (looks like 123456789:AA…)", "tg.linkHow": "On a phone with Telegram: tap the button, then <b>Start</b> in the bot. On a computer: scan the QR with your phone's camera. Link won't open? Open the bot yourself and send the 6-digit code.", "tg.q1": "No Telegram yet?", "tg.a1": "Install Telegram on the parent's phone (Play Store / App Store), sign up with your phone number, then start at step 1. The child's phone does not need Telegram.", "tg.q2": "“Wrong token” or “used somewhere else”?", "tg.a2": "Wrong token: copy BotFather's whole message and paste it, the page picks the token out. Used somewhere else: that bot already belongs to another phone, make a new bot for this child (one bot per child). Token leaked? Send /revoke to BotFather for a new one and paste it again.", "tg.q3": "Tapped Start but the bot says nothing?", "tg.a3": "A link code works for 15 minutes: tap Other code and try again. Check the child's phone is online (the bot runs on it: no internet, no bot).", "tg.h": "Telegram", "tg.d": "See, control and get alerts through your own Telegram bot. No IP, Tailscale or relay needed", "tg.p": "The child phone runs your family's own Telegram bot: send commands in Telegram (/status, /bonus 30, /lock, /locate, /screen…) and get alerts for SOS, more-time requests (with answer buttons), new apps, wrong PINs with a photo.", "tg.s1": "Tap the button to open @BotFather (Telegram's official bot), tap <b>Start</b>, then answer like this:", "tg.s2": "In BotFather's last message, tap the token line (looks like 123456789:AA…) to copy it. Or long-press the whole message → Copy: pasting the whole message works too. Keep the token secret: whoever has it controls the bot.", "tg.s3": "The child's phone gets the token and starts the bot in a few seconds.", "tg.tok": "Bot token", "tg.connect": "Connect", "tg.privacy": "Messages, photos and recordings go through Telegram's servers (not end-to-end encrypted). The token stays on the child phone. The phone keeps one waiting connection to Telegram (very little battery / data). Release, unpair and clear data are not offered over Telegram.", "tg.bot": "Bot", "tg.chats": "Linked chats", "tg.noChats": "No chat yet.", "tg.unlink": "Remove", "tg.codeP": "Or open {0} and send the code:", "tg.until": "expires {0}", "tg.newCode": "Make a link code", "tg.cmds": "Send /help to the bot for the commands.", "tg.off": "Turn the Telegram bot off", "tg.nChats": "{0} chat(s)", "tg.setDone": "Token sent to the child phone", "tg.codeDone": "New code made", "tg.offDone": "Bot turned off", "tg.offAsk": "Turn the Telegram bot off? The phone forgets the token and every linked chat.", "tg.unDone": "Chat removed", "tg.unAsk": "Remove this chat? It gets no alerts and can't control the phone any more.", "tg.e.bad token": "Wrong token. Copy it again from @BotFather.", "tg.e.conflict": "Something else uses this token (a webhook or another app reading it). One bot per child phone.", "tg.e.telegram unreachable": "The child phone can't reach Telegram.", "cr.tgSet.bad token": "Wrong token. Copy it again from @BotFather.", "cr.tgSet.telegram unreachable": "The child phone can't reach Telegram, try again later.", "tg.s1h": "Create a bot (about 1 minute)", "tg.openBf": "Open @BotFather", "tg.s2h": "Copy the token", "tg.s3h": "Paste it here and tap Connect", "tg.runs": "The bot runs on the child phone", "tg.live": "Running", "tg.errTag": "Problem", "tg.since": "Linked {0}", "tg.addFirst": "Link your Telegram", "tg.addMore": "Add someone (other parent, grandparents…)", "tg.qrAlt": "QR code that opens the Telegram bot", "tg.openLink": "Open Telegram and link", "tg.again": "Other code", "tg.max": "5 chats already. Remove one to add someone.", "tg.tryH": "How to use it", "tg.tryP": "In the bot tap 📋 Menu for buttons (no commands to remember), or type commands. SOS, more-time requests (with Give / No buttons), new apps and wrong PINs (with a photo) go to every linked chat.", "tg.noChatTag": "Not linked",
